WEBVTT

00:10:58.964 --> 00:11:02.844
and complexed and nuanced
for the general public to understand,

00:11:02.868 --> 00:11:04.463
let alone debate.

00:11:04.487 --> 00:11:07.083
After all, this is "national security."

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:09.391
There needs to be secrets.

00:11:10.677 --> 00:11:12.581
Don't let that put you off.

00:11:12.605 --> 00:11:14.416
We debate all sorts of issues

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.701
that are critically important
to our lives --

00:11:16.725 --> 00:11:19.113
why should nuclear weapons
be any different?

00:11:19.137 --> 00:11:22.153
We debate health care,
education, the environment.

00:11:22.177 --> 00:11:25.195
Surely congressional oversight,

00:11:25.605 --> 00:11:29.615
civic participation that are
such hallmarks of US democracy,

00:11:29.639 --> 00:11:31.590
surely they apply here.